  "changelog": "rust-analyzer package 0.1.0\n\nMinimum Cadencr application version: 0.16.1. This release publishes package assets only. Production marketplace catalog admission, the LSP revocation feed and the desktop release remain separate rollout steps.\n\nCanonical archive and runtime qualification: https://github.com/merkr-software/CadencR/actions/runs/42215738947\n\nPackaged binary deployment floors: macOS ARM 15.0.0, macOS Intel 15.0.0. Runtime qualification used macOS 15 on both architectures and Ubuntu 22.04/24.04 x86_64; older OS runtime certification and application OS support are separate. Project intelligence requires a Rust toolchain with cargo and rust-src, plus project dependencies.\n\n<!-- cadencr-publication-binding:sha256:5dd5feea44f1f27a638c8a8490ce941ee2a560ebae91cfeecb2b02421be9cd4b -->"
